# GitHub Actions Secrets for Surgeon-Pro

Go to your new repo → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → New repository secret

Required secrets:

| Secret Name              | Value                          | Notes |
|--------------------------|--------------------------------|-------|
| `SURGEON_PRO_BOT_TOKEN`  | `8940645578:AAGLaU8gwmO-y_Tw3M3-7zTh4k_RXkfB0aM` | The Pro bot token you provided |
| `SURGEON_PRO_CHAT_ID`    | `8777453390`                   | The Pro channel/chat ID |
| `SUPABASE_URL`           | your supabase project URL      | Can reuse same DB or create a new one |
| `SUPABASE_KEY`           | your supabase service key      | |
| `HELIUS_API_KEY`         | your Helius key                | For Solana smart money + safety |

Optional:
- `GOPLUS_APP_KEY`
- `GOPLUS_APP_SECRET`

After adding the secrets, enable the workflows (Actions tab) and run a manual `workflow_dispatch` on Scan to test.
